## Osteomalacia oncog√©nica as a critical syndrome

Osteomalacia oncog√©nica is a rare paraneoplastic syndrome characterized by biochemical abnormalities and bone mineralization issues similar to hypophosphatemic rickets. This condition is significant due to its association with various tumors and the potential for severe health consequences. The relationship between osteomalacia oncog√©nica and its underlying causes, particularly mesenchymal tumors, highlights the importance of understanding this syndrome for effective diagnosis and treatment. [Data: Entities (5721); Relationships (15123, 15133)]

