Hypertension is commonly associated with other health conditions, such as diabetes mellitus type 2 and obesity. The management of HTA in these populations is critical, as it can significantly affect overall health outcomes. Understanding the interplay between these conditions is essential for developing effective treatment and prevention strategies. [Data: Entities (11395); Relationships (13254, 15302)]

