The nitrogen balance (BN) calculation involves measuring nitrogen intake and excretion, which is crucial for assessing protein metabolism. This process is essential for understanding how well a patient is utilizing protein and can inform clinical decisions regarding dietary interventions. Accurate measurement of nitrogen balance is vital for optimizing patient care, particularly in settings where nutritional support is critical for recovery. [Data: Relationships (7471)]# Cuidado Paliativo y Enfermos Geri√°tricos

