The relationships among various nutrition journals, including CLIN NUTR, Maturitas, and AM J CARDIOL, illustrate a collaborative network that enhances the dissemination of research findings. These journals collectively publish studies on the impact of nutrition on various health conditions, including cardiovascular health and critical care settings. This interconnectedness not only broadens the reach of important research but also fosters a multidisciplinary approach to understanding nutrition's role in health [Data: Relationships (9367, 9375, 9105, +more)].

## Research on malnutrition screening tools

The publication of research on the Malnutrition Universal Screening Tool (MUST) in CLIN NUTR highlights the journal's commitment to addressing malnutrition, a significant concern in clinical settings. This tool is essential for identifying patients at risk of malnutrition, thereby facilitating timely interventions. The emphasis on such screening tools reflects the community's focus on improving patient outcomes through better nutritional assessment and support [Data: Entities (5594); Relationships (9368, +more)].¯U␀␀␀␀␀␀¡`␀␀␀␀␀␀xn␀␀␀␀␀␀∂y␀␀␀␀␀␀ÎÜ␀␀␀␀␀␀»í␀␀␀␀␀␀»õ␀␀␀␀␀␀≈ß␀␀␀␀␀␀‘∂␀␀␀␀␀␀√␀␀␀␀␀␀ùœ␀␀␀␀␀␀•Ÿ␀␀␀␀␀␀üÁ␀␀␀␀␀␀?˙␀␀␀␀␀␀æ␀␀␀␀␀∫␀␀␀␀␀W␀␀␀␀␀N.␀␀␀␀␀‚9␀␀␀␀␀ÚF␀␀␀␀␀UX␀␀␀␀␀Hf␀␀␀␀␀Ur␀␀␀␀␀(␀␀␀␀␀Oã␀␀␀␀␀Ìî␀␀␀␀␀I°␀␀␀␀␀CÆ␀␀␀␀␀Q∏␀␀␀␀␀`√␀␀␀␀␀6“␀␀␀␀␀∏›␀␀␀␀␀åÎ␀␀␀␀␀˜␀␀␀␀␀K␀␀␀␀␀|␀␀␀␀␀K␀␀␀␀␀c#␀␀␀␀␀ò1␀␀␀␀␀õ=␀␀␀␀␀˛I␀␀␀␀␀ÔU␀␀␀␀␀Ëd␀␀␀␀␀øo␀␀␀␀␀t{␀␀␀␀␀bà␀␀␀␀␀mì␀␀␀␀␀ﬁü␀␀␀␀␀s¨␀␀␀␀␀’∏␀␀␀␀␀H≈␀␀␀␀␀´—␀␀␀␀␀µﬂ␀␀␀␀␀õÌ␀␀␀␀␀◊¸␀␀␀␀␀2	␀␀␀␀␀°␀␀␀␀␀X␀␀␀␀␀Ä+␀␀␀␀␀¸5␀␀␀␀␀îB␀␀␀␀␀‹O␀␀␀␀␀S\␀␀␀␀␀˝m␀␀␀␀␀é~␀␀␀␀␀Rå␀␀␀␀␀qò␀␀␀␀␀Í¢␀␀␀␀␀¥Æ␀␀␀␀␀⁄º␀␀␀␀␀E«␀␀␀␀␀’␀␀␀␀␀≤„␀␀␀␀␀d␀␀␀␀␀ˆ␀␀␀␀␀␀9␀␀␀␀␀9␀␀␀␀␀ì%␀␀␀␀␀N2␀␀␀␀␀á>␀␀␀␀␀˛I␀␀␀␀␀V␀␀␀␀␀Hc␀␀␀␀␀¯o␀␀␀␀␀ã|␀␀␀␀␀§Ü␀␀␀␀␀pì␀␀␀␀␀Ô†␀␀␀␀␀≠≠␀␀␀␀␀L∫␀␀␀␀␀å«␀␀␀␀␀Â÷␀␀␀␀␀«‚␀␀␀␀␀Ô␀␀␀␀␀1␀␀␀␀␀-␀␀␀␀␀—␀␀␀␀␀å)␀␀␀␀␀Ù4␀␀␀␀␀∏B␀␀␀␀␀4O␀␀␀␀␀+\␀␀␀␀␀Kj␀␀␀␀␀‡w␀␀␀␀␀ÔÑ␀␀␀␀␀Yï␀␀␀␀␀≈ü␀␀␀␀␀˛©␀␀␀␀␀ß∂␀␀␀␀␀K√␀␀␀␀␀ˆÕ␀␀␀␀␀"Ÿ␀␀␀␀␀ÄÁ␀␀␀␀␀˙Û␀␀␀␀␀ˆ˝␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¬␀␀␀␀␀ë%␀␀␀␀␀b0␀␀␀␀␀V<␀␀␀␀␀ÛF␀␀␀␀␀„S␀␀␀␀␀|b␀␀␀␀␀Ôo␀␀␀␀␀Êz␀␀␀␀␀)Ü␀␀␀␀␀$ï␀␀␀␀␀Sü␀␀␀␀␀)´␀␀␀␀␀¥␀␀␀␀␀y≈␀␀␀␀␀iœ␀␀␀␀␀é‡␀␀␀␀␀ÅÍ␀␀␀␀␀ø˘␀␀␀␀␀î␀␀␀␀␀–␀␀␀␀␀¯␀␀␀␀␀W'␀␀␀␀␀ö2␀␀␀␀␀§>␀␀␀␀␀†L␀␀␀␀␀
